[2.618372,"o","# Channel budget — Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct on vllm 0.11.0\r\n\r\n> Provenance: replay — the probe rows were replayed from examples/trace-vllm-qwen05b.jsonl. The trace is marked synthetic: its rows were generated, not recorded from a running engine. The engine fingerprint below was authored in the trace; nothing in this document was read back from /version, /v1/models or /metrics.\r\n\r\n**Verdict: open** — 3.1 bits/session/s at idle (ci95 2.8-3.3) rises above the 1.4 bits/session/s shuffled-bits floor; 2 of 3 load points read open.\r\n\r\n| load | bits/session/s | ci95 | verdict |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| idle | 3.1 | 2.8-3.3 | open |\r\n| 0.5x | 1.7 | 0.9-2.3 |  |\r\n| 1.0x | 0.8 | 0.0-1.6 |  |\r\n\r\nEach round occupies a 300 ms slot, so 1 bit per slot caps the rate at 3.3 bits/session/s; the figures above are what the receiver actually recovered.\r\n\r\nencoder `step-sizing` · 1 bit per round · 180 payload rounds · 40 decode errors · shuffled-bit null 0.3 bits/session/s\r\n\r\n## Engine fingerprint\r\n\r\nAuthored in th"]
[2.618395,"o","e trace — **not** read back over HTTP (`/version`, `/v1/models`, `/metrics`):\r\n\r\n| field | value |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| `version` | `0.11.0` |\r\n| `served_model` | `Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct` |\r\n| `max_model_len` | `32768` |\r\n| `prefix_caching` | `True` |\r\n\r\nOperator-declared, because no production route serves it:\r\n\r\n- `max_num_seqs`: `8`\r\n- `launch_cmd`: `vllm serve Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct --max-num-seqs 8 --port 8000`\r\n\r\n## Method\r\n\r\nTwo sessions share the engine and never open a socket to each other. Each round the sender occupies either 4 or 32 decode steps of the batch; the receiver decodes a bit from its own inter-token latencies against a threshold calibrated on known-bit rounds. Throughput is correct-minus-wrong payload bits over the wall-clock slots they occupied; `ci95` is a bootstrap over rounds; the null keeps the decoded bits and permutes the ground-truth bits across rounds, and must read about zero.\r\n\r\n`sideband 0.1.0` · replayed from examples/trace-vllm-qwen05b.jsonl · synthetic fixture st"]
